{"id":"76ba297c-5908-44b4-b7ba-0f095ce91317","createdAt":"2026-10-27T05:10:49.743Z","batchId":"pricing_qwen3-8-flash-gateway_low","approach":"html","modelId":"qwen3.8-flash-gateway","settings":{"effort":"low"},"presetId":"pricing","prompt":"A pricing page with three plans (Free, Pro, Team), their features and a call to action for each.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<h1>Pricing</h1>\n<p class=\"lead\">Simple, transparent pricing that scales with your team. Start free, upgrade when you're ready.</p>\n\n<div class=\"row gap-lg\" style=\"align-items:center;margin:1.5rem 0 2.5rem;\">\n  <label class=\"check\" style=\"gap:0.5rem;\">\n    <input type=\"radio\" name=\"billing\" value=\"monthly\" checked onchange=\"switchBilling('monthly')\"> Monthly\n  </label>\n  <label class=\"check\" style=\"gap:0.5rem;\">\n    <input type=\"radio\" name=\"billing\" value=\"yearly\" onchange=\"switchBilling('yearly')\"> Yearly <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Save 20%</span>\n  </label>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"grid cols-3\" id=\"pricing-grid\">\n\n  <div class=\"card\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;\">\n    <div class=\"stack gap-lg\" style=\"flex:1;\">\n      <div>\n        <h3>Free</h3>\n        <p class=\"muted small\">For individuals exploring the platform</p>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <span class=\"stat-value\" data-monthly=\"0\" data-yearly=\"0\">$0</span>\n        <span class=\"muted small\" data-period=\"/month\"></span>\n      </div>\n      <hr>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span class=\"down\">✓</span><span>Up to 3 projects</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span class=\"down\">✓</span><span>1 team member</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span class=\"down\">✓</span><span>1 GB storage</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span class=\"down\">✓</span><span>Community support</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span class=\"muted\">✗</span><span class=\"muted\">Version history</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span class=\"muted\">✗</span><span class=\"muted\">API access</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span class=\"muted\">✗</span><span class=\"muted\">Priority support</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <button class=\"btn btn-outline btn-block\" style=\"margin-top:1.5rem;\">Get started</button>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;border:2px solid var(--accent);position:relative;\">\n    <span class=\"badge\" style=\"position:absolute;top:-0.6rem;right:1rem;\">Most popular</span>\n    <div class=\"stack gap-lg\" style=\"flex:1;\">\n      <div>\n        <h3>Pro</h3>\n        <p class=\"muted small\">For professionals and small teams</p>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <span class=\"stat-value\" data-monthly=\"24\" data-yearly=\"19\">$24</span>\n        <span class=\"muted small\" data-period=\"/month\"></span>\n      </div>\n      <hr>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span class=\"down\">✓</span><span>Unlimited projects</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span class=\"down\">✓</span><span>Up to 5 team members</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span class=\"down\">✓</span><span>50 GB storage</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span class=\"down\">✓</span><span>90-day version history</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span class=\"down\">✓</span><span>API access (10k req/day)</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span class=\"down\">✓</span><span>Email support</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span class=\"muted\">✗</span><span class=\"muted\">SSO / SAML</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <button class=\"btn btn-block\" style=\"margin-top:1.5rem;\">Start 14-day trial</button>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;\">\n    <div class=\"stack gap-lg\" style=\"flex:1;\">\n      <div>\n        <h3>Team</h3>\n        <p class=\"muted small\">For growing organizations</p>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <span class=\"stat-value\" data-monthly=\"59\" data-yearly=\"47\">$59</span>\n        <span class=\"muted small\" data-period=\"/month per seat\"></span>\n      </div>\n      <hr>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span class=\"down\">✓</span><span>Everything in Pro</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span class=\"down\">✓</span><span>Unlimited team members</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span class=\"down\">✓</span><span>500 GB storage</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span class=\"down\">✓</span><span>Unlimited version history</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span class=\"down\">✓</span><span>API access (100k req/day)</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span class=\"down\">✓</span><span>SSO / SAML</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span class=\"down\">✓</span><span>Priority support + Slack</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <button class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-block\" style=\"margin-top:1.5rem;\">Contact sales</button>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:2.5rem;\">\n  <h3 class=\"card-title\">Feature comparison</h3>\n  <table>\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th>Feature</th>\n        <th style=\"text-align:center;\">Free</th>\n        <th style=\"text-align:center;\">Pro</th>\n        <th style=\"text-align:center;\">Team</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr><td>Projects</td><td class=\"num\">3</td><td class=\"num\">Unlimited</td><td class=\"num\">Unlimited</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Team members</td><td class=\"num\">1</td><td class=\"num\">5</td><td class=\"num\">Unlimited</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Storage</td><td class=\"num\">1 GB</td><td class=\"num\">50 GB</td><td class=\"num\">500 GB</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Version history</td><td class=\"num\">—</td><td class=\"num\">90 days</td><td class=\"num\">Unlimited</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>API requests/day</td><td class=\"num\">—</td><td class=\"num\">10,000</td><td class=\"num\">100,000</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Custom domains</td><td class=\"num\">—</td><td class=\"num\">3</td><td class=\"num\">Unlimited</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>SSO / SAML</td><td class=\"num\">—</td><td class=\"num\">—</td><td class=\"num\">✓</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Audit logs</td><td class=\"num\">—</td><td class=\"num\">—</td><td class=\"num\">✓</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Dedicated support</td><td class=\"num\">—</td><td class=\"num\">—</td><td class=\"num\">✓</td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:2rem;text-align:center;\">\n  <p class=\"muted\">All plans include a 14-day money-back guarantee. Prices in USD, billed in your local currency.</p>\n</div>\n\n<script>\nfunction switchBilling(mode) {\n  const cards = document.querySelectorAll('#pricing-grid .card');\n  cards.forEach(function(card) {\n    const el = card.querySelector('.stat-value');\n    const periodEl = card.querySelector('[data-period]');\n    const monthly = el.getAttribute('data-monthly');\n    const yearly = el.getAttribute('data-yearly');\n    if (mode === 'yearly') {\n      el.textContent = '$' + yearly;\n      if (periodEl) periodEl.textContent = periodEl.getAttribute('data-monthly') ? '/month billed annually' : '/month';\n    } else {\n      el.textContent = '$' + monthly;\n    }\n  });\n}\n</script>","deltas":[[3154,"<h1>Pricing"],[3157,"</"],[3238,"h1>\n"],[3309,"